Package: splitSurveyDesign
Type: Package
Title: Design and Analysis Tools for Split Questionnaire Surveys
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Xiaoning", "Wang", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "sdwangxiaoning@cuc.edu.cn")
Author: Xiaoning Wang [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Xiaoning Wang <sdwangxiaoning@cuc.edu.cn>
Description: Dependency-free tools for constructing split questionnaire
    patterns, allocating samples under cost or variance criteria, estimating
    means from planned-missing survey data, simple imputation, generalized
    regression estimation, and design evaluation by simulation.
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
